      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "0414831e11ffc95f1b34e09fc165a90e6beb0e359bc886c0887460d5ef721d32:000000_-5525548898560166794:g0:r13",
      "row_index_0based": 13,
      "serialized_row_index": 13,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そうですね。クレハさんのお友達を入れたら――。<interval=0.4>\n待ってください。誰かが来ます！"
      ],
